  "findings": [
    "All five candidates match the expected seat count and have a complete unique AC_NO sequence from 1 through the expected total.",
    "Assam has 20 invalid geometries; Kerala has 1; Tamil Nadu has 2. These files cannot be imported as-is.",
    "West Bengal has duplicate constituency name 'Bishnupur' for AC 146 and AC 255; this requires official verification rather than silent normalization.",
    "Puducherry passes basic feature count, geometry validity and AC number sequence checks, but remains secondary-source evidence until the direct ECI source and effective-date provenance are verified.",
    "The five files contain 824 features in total, with 23 invalid geometries.",
    "No candidate was promoted to OFFICIAL, inserted into canonical runtime geography, or written to any database."
  ],
  "finalDisposition": "Useful secondary candidates, not official production boundaries. Direct ECI acquisition remains blocked by HTTP 406 on official index pages and HTTP 404 on guessed geometry endpoints. Continue primary-source acquisition and do not synthesize or silently repair geometry."
